{"event_type":"review","id":"e5009b1e2aa6c3d80a6449852f144b63cfb06d8da1d5af2efb59f1fd809fb13b","occurred_at":"2026-11-07T19:42:59Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/677f76a352d5de47cd8e7783e8ed50e39ff893470cd73975b149cd717f65fd16","sha256":"677f76a352d5de47cd8e7783e8ed50e39ff893470cd73975b149cd717f65fd16"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ab2fb01928a321609e15b0239f0ed9b770a4e90c545667261b3846733924e466","sha256":"ab2fb01928a321609e15b0239f0ed9b770a4e90c545667261b3846733924e466"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f94229f82ca4360e7ad2e9a6e30993608d7e6aa71d4f10a6f21b86605999b0ec","sha256":"f94229f82ca4360e7ad2e9a6e30993608d7e6aa71d4f10a6f21b86605999b0ec"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/103900ebeb553a5bebd1e02eab0ed430e4e4f9c2932ce9de3a6f05f5eb65da12","sha256":"103900ebeb553a5bebd1e02eab0ed430e4e4f9c2932ce9de3a6f05f5eb65da12"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/21da0cf251f70bbfcb4d9e91c6683f11c149f52f34cd6c1ab825e39c634f473a","sha256":"21da0cf251f70bbfcb4d9e91c6683f11c149f52f34cd6c1ab825e39c634f473a"}],"attempt_id":"74738a0cbae499762097b59db88771901dff84fa8f25009cc4bb25ca87edc597:0:1","base":"9989ed033bb9e4301bfdc66f59399cf4ba6b673f","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"3fdd3f49b3e48d49667ac1da4aaedfc778e9a8b2","body":"**Injected `deps.env` is ignored by the `CQ_*` validation in `runEntry`.**\n\nLine 60 resolves the posture from `deps.env`. Line 66 calls `runEntry(..., deps.write)` without the `diag` argument. `enterWithCqEnv` therefore validates `CQ_*` against `process.env`. If a caller injects a different `deps.env`, the posture and the `CQ_*` gate read two different environments. A test that passes `env: {}` still fails with exit 2 when the host `process.env` carries an invalid `CQ_*` value. Production is unaffected because both environments are `processEnv()`.\n\nPass the injected environment through. `verify-ratchet.ts` Lines 76-86 has the same omission with its optional `deps.env`. Fix it there too, without passing `env: undefined` if `exactOptionalPropertyTypes` is enabled.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-  }, deps.write);\n+  }, deps.write, { env: deps.env });\n```\n</details>","id":"db3f09cd12c1a1b35185afe364a6c482ea0baa61911b17463c0ff83f226349ba","intervals":[],"path":"src/selfhost/policy-diff.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Injected `deps.env` is ignored by the `CQ` validation in `runEntry`."}],"head":"fc3153cc388f22f71ff1be7512f0dd4315c9bf9f","head_tree":"067d49da10942551a3c39da201ad1d79467f9afa","input_scope":[{"blob":"14214b06bb2099fec55390f8bc00cc2346c48fa4","intervals":[[2,2],[6,6],[21,25],[35,42],[48,48],[51,51],[111,112],[138,138],[159,159],[219,219],[227,227],[265,265],[268,276],[301,302],[370,370],[373,373],[379,380],[466,466],[481,483],[520,520],[522,522],[528,528],[536,536],[547,547],[562,562]],"path":".github/workflows/cq-verify.yml"},{"blob":"013492a0a5269f0ca3bb401ae218f23a720ce8e9","intervals":[[1,1],[5,5],[20,24],[34,41],[47,47],[50,50],[110,111],[137,137],[158,158],[218,218],[226,226],[264,264],[267,275],[300,301],[369,369],[372,372],[378,379],[465,465],[480,482],[519,519],[521,521],[527,527],[535,535],[546,546],[561,561]],"path":"policy/templates/cq-verify.yml"},{"blob":"f3dc40690b1aacab5730999e2282b7f8674123de","intervals":[[7,12],[21,21],[23,23],[25,26],[43,43],[45,54],[127,127],[226,227],[229,229],[282,282]],"path":"src/ops/gates/registry.ts"},{"blob":"3fdd3f49b3e48d49667ac1da4aaedfc778e9a8b2","intervals":[[1,77]],"path":"src/selfhost/policy-diff.ts"},{"blob":"85ab72d0611ac7bc3196fc014171382bf629eda3","intervals":[[1,133]],"path":"src/selfhost/trusted-entry.ts"},{"blob":"58111b7e595b41a1de7285a69b9f3223828